<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>One year after Big Eating Festival 804―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\gotmail.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン見る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we've decided to set up a branch office in Sawa Prefecture, and we're planning to hire a few employees. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, what do you think...? There's still a full-time position open...”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had mostly finished tidying up my room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, the president was keeping up the same passionate approach as ever.<PG>
Days of following the urges to eat, sleep, breathe that even a baby can manage, and waiting for my natural span of life to run out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was how it was supposed to be, but―<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“President, I am truly sorry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I cannot accept it after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I have a dream now.”</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Having no dreams and no hope is a thing of the past.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE>, your visitor's here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Coming!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing Mom's voice, I clicked the send button and shut down the computer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Long time no see, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's been a long time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... So you can speak clearly now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, it took a little rehab, but I'm fine now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gave <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE> a big grin.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Well then, let's go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\空港.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We arrived at Sawa Airport.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here we were heading to America.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've become number one in Japan, but out in the world there must still be powerhouses I've never met.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that it's come to this, I'm going to become the number one big eater in the world!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\自由の女神.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―In team competitions we kept showing unmatched strength and winning, and we took home plenty of prize money too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a few years, we were being invited to contests here and there, and we were earning enough to eat for a living.<PG>
But there are people like this in every country.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People who say big eaters waste food and devour even the share meant for underprivileged children.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to brush off that kind of criticism, but it's also a fact that there are children who die while wishing to live.<PG>
So <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE> and I kept donating most of the prize money we won.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I was saved by competitive eating, I act for the people who wish to live.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, the people saved are probably only a few percent of the whole.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I want to save anyone I can, even if it's just one person.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\アフリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Eventually, through eating, we became interested in ingredients and farming too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> advice, </STYLE>I used the genius brain I was born with to develop plants that could be grown locally as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE> had grown up in the countryside in the mountains, so she knew a lot about that sort of thing.<PG>
At first we mainly donated farming equipment and food, but that way the local people couldn't use them for long.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because when the equipment broke, it couldn't be repaired and was left abandoned, or the donated seeds got eaten before they were sown.<PG>
So the question for us was how to grow plants that could be cultivated easily even on barren land and could stave off hunger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We traveled to those places to pass on that technique, and saw it through until the land became rich.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just to one place: we went to many countries, and kept fighting until people's hunger was gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was volunteer work as a team, where my brain and <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san's</STYLE> experience were exactly what counted.<PG>
Thanks to that, in our small way, we succeeded in saving people suffering from famine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In between, we kept entering eating contests, and eventually competitive eating as a sport and our charity work were recognized, and we even started getting sponsors.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And so we went on saving people all over the world who wished to live.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
something in my heart kept smoldering all the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By keeping up my charity work, I keep running away from my own guilt.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―And many years went by.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On this day, the place I set foot in was Oslo, Norway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ノーベル賞.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"This year's Nobel Peace Prize goes to the philanthropists <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya Niimura-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto-san</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
After an eating contest 10 years ago, they became interested in ingredients and agriculture, and they have continued to make innovative contributions to improving the food situation around the world. 
{PAUSE ""}
I provided the play-by-play at that contest 10 years ago, and I remember their performance well. 
{PAUSE ""}
Who could have imagined it would lead to the Nobel Peace Prize?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\拍手.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I climbed the steps and stood before the lectern.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Your Majesties the King and Queen, Your Royal Highnesses the Crown Prince and Crown Princess, and members of the Norwegian Nobel Committee. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Today is a wonderfully happy day for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That the Nobel Committee has chosen us for this noble prize is an honor far beyond what I deserve. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Today, my partner </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is unable to attend for personal reasons, so I will deliver the address in her place."</STYLE><PG>
―There's something I have to say here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something I have to say on this grand, glorious stage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the thing that had been smoldering in my heart for years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last I had been able to realize what it really was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What I have done up to now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That you have judged it worthy of an invitation to an occasion such as this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It makes me very happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">However, there is something I must tell you all."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"When I was 15, there was a very sad incident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That April 8, when I lost the people dear to me all at once―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even now, 14 years later, I cannot forget it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I was the sole survivor of that incident."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"When I came to, I was in a hospital bed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The loneliness of losing the people dear to me, and the helplessness of not having been able to save them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hopeless days without the people dear to me, tormented by helplessness―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I decided to take my own life."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But that attempt failed, and, unfortunately, my life was saved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">At the same time, I lost my voice, and on top of that I lost the will to live, and even the will to die."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"All I had left was the survival instinct to eat, sleep, breathe. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I avoided all contact with people, and every day was nothing but waiting for death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">One day, after more than 4 years of that life, a chance came to me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Something I could do with a mouth good for nothing but eating. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Only one thing made me different from other people. It was my special talent of being able to eat more than others."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"When I leapt into that world, everyone cheered me on, celebrated me―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Once again, I came to wish to live. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Not just eat, sleep, breathe. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The wish to live, the survival instinct at the root of all of them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In this world there are many lives that wish to live just the same, yet are lost with that wish unfulfilled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if they could get even a little food into their mouths, that desire could be satisfied. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I understand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The wish to live rising to the surface, something ordinary people would probably never be aware of―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">how painful that is."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I have no sense that I am doing charity work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">There are people writhing in the suffering I went through, so I am only doing what I can. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If they live in the same society, even animals, even toddlers still unsteady on their feet, will try to share food with one of their own kind in front of them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This, too, is an instinct: the wish to help people who wish to live. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I am simply living by my instincts."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Because... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">it hurts, doesn't it...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　When you can't help the people you want to help, it really hurts!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　When you can't help the people you want to help, it hurts so much it could kill you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　You even start to want to die!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　You even lose your voice!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That is why... that is why I am not doing anything like charity work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I am only doing it for myself, because I do not want to suffer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Everyone is simply going along with my selfish, instinctive desire. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If I stopped my 'charity work' now, I am sure I would lose my voice again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This is the only way I can live."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Even now, my guilt toward the people I lost 14 years ago smolders in my heart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Helping other people will not bring back the ones I lost. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... when someone else is saved, my guilt eases."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"So, everyone... this is a selfish request. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If there is someone in front of you whom you might be able to help, even just a tiny bit is fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even just helping them up, even just giving them one piece of candy, is fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Please, help the people you can help."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"By rights, I had intended to decline the Nobel Peace Prize. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But my partner </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said to me, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">'If we're given an occasion like this, we can tell the whole world what we want to say. More people will be saved.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That is what she told me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I am selfish. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I do not remember which country's people I helped, or how many. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Nor do I know what they think of me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">To be honest, I am not interested, either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It is only that I want to be saved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hungry people just happened to be there for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It was only supply and demand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That is all it is."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Everyone... please do not become like me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What I am doing is pure hypocrisy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I am a hypocrite who, instead of aiming to help, uses it as a means of saving myself, and is respected by everyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I am a selfish </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ひきょうもの">coward</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I respect, from the bottom of my heart, those who can help others out of compassion."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Lastly, I have been entrusted with a letter from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, so I will read it aloud."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Everyone, I apologize that I am unable even to show my face today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">As </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> here has said, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> suffered greatly in the past, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">no, even now she continues to carry that guilt. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I bear responsibility for this as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I am also the one truly responsible for tormenting </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Therefore, I have no right to stand here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Had I not made a mistake, I am sure the people dear to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would have been saved as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I had exposed my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">father</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> back then, in my childhood―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ironically, thanks to that, many lives are being saved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Everyone, please, for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> sake and for mine as well, save those you can save. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I am honored to receive such a prize, but for me it is far too painful a thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">For me, this is a sin, and also a punishment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Like </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I have no intention of speaking pretty words."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"From now on, too, we will surely continue our charity work, our </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しょくざい">atonement</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Everyone, if you would say that you recognize our work, then please, for our sake as well, help many people."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\拍手.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When I finished reading the letter, applause rose from the hall after a slightly awkward pause.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We had only said honestly what we thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An occasion like this is no reason to line up pretty words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being thought of as a compassionate person is far too painful.<PG>
Once I step down from this platform, I intend to go straight back to Japan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not going to the press conference or the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ばんさんかい">banquet</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to run away from here right now.<PG>
Until now, I've only ever told <STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-san</STYLE> the reason for this charity work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To the people around me, I must be a humble, selfless philanthropist.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's ridiculous to call me humble and selfless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All this time steeped in desire, still swallowed by a wish that cannot come true.<PG>
No matter how much charity work I do, how much I <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="しょくざい">atone</STYLE>, how many people I save―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My wish will never come true, whatever I do.<PG>
